sequenceDiagram

actor Visitor
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as routes/providers.js or vehicles.js
participant V as Public validation middleware
participant C as Provider or vehicle controller
participant S as Provider or vehicle service
participant M as Provider or Vehicle model
participant DB as MongoDB
Visitor->>Server: GET /api/v1/providers or /vehicles, list or detail
Server->>Route: Match public route
Route->>V: Validate ID or allowlisted query, reject body
V->>C: req.validated
activate C
C->>S: listPublic... or getPublic...
activate S
S->>S: Build approved provider/profile pipeline
opt Vehicle discovery
    S->>S: Require active vehicle and non-expired offering
    opt Date-filtered vehicle list
        S->>S: Require full date interval inside offering
        S->>S: Exclude inclusive overlap with confirmed bookings
    end
end
S->>M: Execute provider or vehicle aggregation
M->>DB: Run aggregation and pagination or detail match
DB-->>S: Eligible records, totals or no detail
S-->>C: Page or record, missing detail throws 404
deactivate S
C->>C: Serialize public fields
C-->>Server: 200 JSON page or detail
deactivate C
Server-->>Visitor: JSON response
Note over Visitor,DB: Search is advisory, booking writes recheck eligibility inside their transaction
